Package: hdbpp-es
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: libhdb++mysql7
Description: HDB++ EventSubscriber Tango device server
 The HDB++ EventSubscriber (hdb++es-srv) subscribes to the Tango archive
 events of the attributes assigned to it and writes them through libhdb++
 and a database backend into the archive.
